 "summary": "The core-level `firstChernClass`, `firstChernClass_eq_zero_of_isEmpty` and the bundle-pair `maslovIndex` with its naturality and triviality lemmas have no existing counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti; the existing `maslovIndex` definitions are for paths and loops (symplectic/unitary paths, totally real loops, Heegaard diagrams). The proofs reuse `firstChernClass_eq_of_fiberwise`, `firstChernClass_eq_zero_of_linearIndependent`, `doubleAlongIso`, `doubleAlongTrivialIso` and `rank_eq_of_iso` rather than re-deriving them.",
